{"seq":12,"slug":"interior-architecture","title":"室内建筑与空间设计","stage":"DONE","category":"architecture-urban","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/interior-architecture","rating":{"composite":4.14,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"室内建筑与空间设计\">室内建筑与空间设计</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>室内建筑（Interior Architecture）是建筑学与空间设计的交叉学科，关注建筑内部空间的组织、体验与营造。它不仅涉及表面装饰，更深入到空间结构的重塑、功能流线的优化、人与环境的交互关系。与传统室内设计（Interior Design）相比，室内建筑更强调空间的<strong>结构性介入</strong>——包括墙体改造、楼层贯通、光环境重构等涉及建筑本体的操作。</p>\n<p>本知识库从<strong>原理基础</strong>出发，经由<strong>设计流程</strong>与<strong>类型学实践</strong>，最终抵达<strong>技术前沿</strong>，构建一个完整的室内建筑认知框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"学科定位\">学科定位</h2><p>室内建筑处于以下学科交叉点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>建筑设计</strong> — 空间形态、比例、光影的基本语法</li>\n<li><strong>结构与材料</strong> — 饰面材料性能、构造节点、声热光物理</li>\n<li><strong>人因工程</strong> — 人体尺度、行为心理、通用设计</li>\n<li><strong>环境科学</strong> — 可持续材料、室内空气质量、能效优化</li>\n<li><strong>数字技术</strong> — BIM 协同、参数化设计、智能控制系统</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"章节结构\">章节结构</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>核心问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1. 基础原理</td>\n<td>空间设计语法、人因工学、材料科学</td>\n<td>空间为何让人舒适或不适？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2. 设计流程</td>\n<td>任务书编制、照明设计、色彩策略</td>\n<td>从需求到方案如何系统化推进？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3. 类型学</td>\n<td>住宅、商业办公、酒店零售</td>\n<td>不同业态的空间逻辑有何差异？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4. 技术前沿</td>\n<td>BIM 可视化、可持续健康建筑、智能系统</td>\n<td>技术如何重新定义室内体验？</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"学习路径建议\">学习路径建议</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>先读基础原理</strong>：理解比例、尺度、人体工程学等核心概念</li>\n<li><strong>掌握设计流程</strong>：了解从任务书到施工图的完整链路</li>\n<li><strong>对照类型学案例</strong>：看不同业态如何运用基础原理</li>\n<li><strong>关注技术前沿</strong>：了解 BIM、WELL 认证、智能家居等当代实践</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"与其他知识库的关联\">与其他知识库的关联</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../architectural-design/\">建筑设计原理</a> — 空间形态与组织的上位理论</li>\n<li><a href=\"../structural-materials/\">结构与材料</a> — 建筑材料性能的底层支撑</li>\n<li><a href=\"../building-physics-environment/\">建筑物理与环境</a> — 声、光、热环境的科学基础</li>\n<li><a href=\"../sustainable-net-zero-architecture/\">可持续建筑</a> — 绿色建筑认证与低碳实践</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础原理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/interior-architecture/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"spatial-design-principles","title":"空间设计原理：比例、尺度、韵律、层次与流线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/interior-architecture/foundations/spatial-design-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"human-factors-ergonomics","title":"人体工程学与人因设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/interior-architecture/foundations/human-factors-ergonomics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"materials-finishes","title":"材料与饰面：性能图谱与选型逻辑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/interior-architecture/foundations/materials-finishes"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"design-process","title":"设计流程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/interior-architecture/design-process","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"programming-space-planning","title":"设计任务书与空间规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/interior-architecture/design-process/programming-space-planning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"lighting-design","title":"照明设计：从看见到感受","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/interior-architecture/design-process/lighting-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"color-theory-application","title":"色彩理论与应用：从心理学到空间策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/interior-architecture/design-process/color-theory-application"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"typologies","title":"空间类型学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/interior-architecture/typologies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"residential-interiors","title":"住宅室内设计：从户型优化到生活场景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/interior-architecture/typologies/residential-interiors"},{"seq":2,"slug":"commercial-workplace","title":"商业与办公空间设计：从效率导向到体验驱动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/interior-architecture/typologies/commercial-workplace"},{"seq":3,"slug":"hospitality-retail","title":"酒店与零售空间设计：动线叙事与品牌体验空间化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/interior-architecture/typologies/hospitality-retail"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"technology","title":"技术前沿","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/interior-architecture/technology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bim-visualization","title":"BIM 与可视化：从信息建模到沉浸式设计沟通","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/interior-architecture/technology/bim-visualization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sustainability-wellbeing","title":"可持续与健康建筑：从绿色认证到生物亲和设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/interior-architecture/technology/sustainability-wellbeing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"smart-interior-systems","title":"智能室内系统：从自动化到自适应空间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/interior-architecture/technology/smart-interior-systems"}]}]}